-harness#the-live-smoke-test","content":"It makes real requests against a temporary workspace and checks five things a mock cannot: that a model picks a tool and uses its result, that it produces arguments the schema accepts and the write lands on disk, that a command round-trips through the subprocess seam, that the log records every model-visible fact, and that history derived from the log alone reproduces the conversation."},"2112":{"id":"/docs/extend/mini-harness-56","page_id":"/docs/extend/mini-harness","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extend/mini-harness#the-live-smoke-test","content":"It costs money, which is why it is a script rather than part of pnpm test. Without a key it exits with a message instead of failing."},"2113":{"id":"/docs/extend/mini-harness-57","page_id":"/docs/extend/mini-harness","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extend/mini-harness#next","content":"Extending AgentKit — the mechanism table, if you arrived here first"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/extend/mini-harness-58","page_id":"/docs/extend/mini-harness","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extend/mini-harness#next","content":"Bundles — how to publish a harness others can retune"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/extend/runtime","page_id":"/docs/extend/runtime","type":"page","content":"Agent runtime","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Extending"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extend/runtime"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/extend/runtime-0","page_id":"/docs/extend/runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extend/runtime","content":"Services, the anatomy of a turn, and every extension point"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/extend/runtime-1","page_id":"/docs/extend/runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extend/runtime#services","content":"Services"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/extend/runtime-2","page_id":"/docs/extend/runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extend/runtime#the-turn","content":"The turn"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/extend/runtime-3","page_id":"/docs/extend/runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extend/ru